%% Sprint Bankroll-3 — RF-11 fxResolver cascade (ADR-061)
%% resolveExchangeRates(userId) → cascata users.exchangeRates > wallets.exchangeRates > FALLBACK_FX_RATES.
%% Cache em memoria por userId TTL 5min, invalidado em PUT /user-settings ou /wallets que toquem exchangeRates.
%% Convencao QW-1 (ADR-033): rates[ccy] = unidades de ccy por 1 USD.

flowchart TD
    Caller[Caller: bankrollService / walletService / ticketService<br/>RF-2 RF-4 RF-6 RF-7] --> Call[fxResolver.resolveExchangeRates userId]

    Call --> CacheCheck{Cache hit?<br/>userId in Map<br/>expiresAt > now}

    CacheCheck -->|hit| ReturnCached[Retorna FxRates cacheado<br/>source preservada]
    CacheCheck -->|miss/expired| FetchUser[SELECT exchange_rates FROM users<br/>WHERE user_platform_id=?]

    FetchUser --> UserHas{users.exchangeRates<br/>tem rows?}

    UserHas -->|sim| FetchWallets[SELECT exchange_rates FROM wallets<br/>WHERE user_id=? AND status='active'<br/>ORDER BY updated_at DESC]
    UserHas -->|nao| FetchWalletsNoUser[SELECT exchange_rates FROM wallets<br/>WHERE user_id=? AND status='active']

    FetchWallets --> Merge[Merge logic:<br/>1. base = FALLBACK_FX_RATES<br/>2. para cada wallet: merge wallets.exchangeRates<br/>   conflito: usa wallet mais recente updated_at<br/>3. users.exchangeRates sobreescreve tudo]
    FetchWalletsNoUser --> MergeNoUser[Merge logic:<br/>1. base = FALLBACK_FX_RATES<br/>2. para cada wallet: merge wallets.exchangeRates<br/>3. users vazio - skip step 3]

    Merge --> ClassifySource{Origem<br/>dominante?}
    MergeNoUser --> ClassifySource

    ClassifySource -->|user contribuiu E wallets contribuiram| SourceMixed[source = 'mixed']
    ClassifySource -->|apenas user| SourceUser[source = 'user']
    ClassifySource -->|apenas wallets| SourceWallets[source = 'wallets']
    ClassifySource -->|nenhum - tudo fallback| SourceFallback[source = 'fallback']

    SourceMixed --> Build[Build FxRates:<br/>rates merged, source, resolvedAt = new Date]
    SourceUser --> Build
    SourceWallets --> Build
    SourceFallback --> Build

    Build --> CacheStore[cache.set userId<br/>rates, expiresAt = now + 5min]
    CacheStore --> ReturnFresh[Retorna FxRates fresh]

    ReturnCached --> Helper[Caller usa helper:<br/>convertToUSD amount, currency, rates<br/>= amount / rates[currency]<br/>QW-1: usd = native / rate]
    ReturnFresh --> Helper

    Helper --> Result[Valor convertido]

    Invalidate1[PUT /api/user-settings<br/>body.exchangeRates] -.-> InvalidateCall[fxResolver.invalidateCache userId]
    Invalidate2[POST /api/wallets<br/>body.exchangeRates] -.-> InvalidateCall
    Invalidate3[PUT /api/wallets/:id<br/>body.exchangeRates] -.-> InvalidateCall
    InvalidateCall -.->|cache.delete userId| CacheCheck

    UserNull[userId == null<br/>tests, anonymous] --> ReturnFallbackDirect[Retorna FALLBACK_FX_RATES diretamente<br/>sem query, source='fallback']
    Call --> UserNull

    DBFails[DB falha em FetchUser/FetchWallets] -.-> ReturnFallbackDirect

    Note1[Cascata D9:<br/>users sobreescreve wallets sobreescreve constants.<br/>Currency unknown em rates - cai em FALLBACK_FX_RATES<br/>e em ultimo recurso 1 - currency unknown total]
    Build -.- Note1

    Note2[Refactor seletivo Bankroll-3:<br/>Migrar bankrollService walletService ticketService<br/>Debt RF-11.5: csvParser misc tournament-selector upload currencyNormalizer storage<br/>F4 followup: primedopeIntegration dayDetailService primedopeBucketsPrefill]
    Helper -.- Note2
